      "bytes": 171804,
      "seconds": 1.947,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_029.wav",
      "subtitle": "灯就是在等你来啊！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "speakerId": "adv_taki",
      "text": "……灯在问你话呢。\n而且这也太不负责了吧？",
