      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "423e805a4c6206f53d48a76fa691b433d09c1107f3c0adc64662e79210be20d9",
      "nativeSha256": "47ec9798d3ec73396b4445ed2c35de0a271e8a4afd077ad6040d3b798cbd89dd",
      "bytes": 319886,
      "seconds": 3.626,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_019.wav",
      "subtitle": "……灯在问你话呢。\n而且这也太不负责了吧？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "speakerId": "adv_taki",
      "text": "有什么好解决的，反正是那家伙自己在那闹脾气",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_14_36",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10013",
      "index": 161,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_033.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_033",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "4fa6f40c2c7f3de38b635ccdc7308d8dfa03e8a66c2073bceb786fe65ac332f9",
      "nativeSha256": "bc483cdd4bc87861731c02313d3a20c084cb098c9d0a89c92634ba0b522b3447",
      "bytes": 342206,
      "seconds": 3.879,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_033.wav",
      "subtitle": "有什么好解决的，反正是那家伙自己在那闹脾气"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "speakerId": "adv_taki",
      "text": "那家伙说，不需要你和乐奈……\n她为了留住灯和我，利用了你们！",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_16_54",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10015",
      "index": 324,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_052.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_052",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "ecb58a03ce766743781bb8d6c1f74920ebbea25d67de78b52486adddb5e0d161",
