      "bytes": 756746,
      "seconds": 8.579,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_052.wav",
      "subtitle": "那家伙说，不需要你和乐奈……\n她为了留住灯和我，利用了你们！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "speakerId": "adv_taki",
      "text": "……喂。过来一下",
