      "seconds": 5.42,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_13_026.wav",
      "subtitle": "（太好了……！\n我一直想和灯举办一场这样的演出！）"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "speakerId": "adv_taki",
      "text": "……哈？你对灯保证过\n自己也会组一辈子乐队的吧？那个誓言呢？",
