      "bytes": 458278,
      "seconds": 5.195,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_BandTop_Taki_Spring_01.wav",
      "subtitle": "感觉招募成员的告示变多了……是因为春天来了吗"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "characterId": 5,
      "text": "野猫……又在咖啡厅日照好的地方睡觉了……",
