      "bytes": 397068,
      "seconds": 4.501,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_BandTop_Taki_Spring_02.wav",
      "subtitle": "野猫……又在咖啡厅日照好的地方睡觉了……"
    },
    {
      "slug": "taki",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "taki",
      "characterId": 5,
      "text": "夏天来咖啡厅的客人会变多，还挺忙的",
